  itemId: block_sprinkler
  displayName: Sprinkler
  description: 'Powered irrigation mast with its own water tank. Sprays about 0.4
    L per second over an 8 m radius while it has power and water. Fill the tank by
    hand with a Liquid Canister, or connect a pipe or tank within 3.5 m and it refills
    itself. Every planting box, farm plot and sapling bed inside the radius counts
    as irrigated. Holds its own water tank: fill it by hand with a Liquid Canister,
    or connect a pipe for automatic refill. Draws about 20 W while it sprays. Holds
    its own water tank: fill it by hand with a Liquid Canister, or connect a pipe
    for automatic refill. Draws about 20 W while it sprays. Holds its own water tank:
    fill it by hand with a Liquid Canister, or connect a pipe for automatic refill.
    Draws about 20 W while it sprays. Holds its own water tank: fill it by hand with
    a Liquid Canister, or connect a pipe for automatic refill. Draws about 20 W while
    it sprays.'
